    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "But wouldn't focusing too much on power struggles and injustice risk making kids feel alienated or even ashamed of their own country? I'm worried that if we don't emphasize shared values, we'll lose that sense of national unity that's so important for a stable society. How do you reconcile that risk?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
