      "content": "The goal shouldn't be to make students feel ashamed, but to make them critically aware citizens who can build a *better* nation. Acknowledging past failures is not the same as abandoning national pride; it's about demanding a more honest and equitable future. True national strength comes from the ability to self-correct and improve, not from pretending flaws don't exist.",
      "source": "target",
